data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. Yolanta Birkhane Studio\nDescription: A SWEDEN BASED WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER BLENDING GENUINE FRAMES WITH AN EDITORIAL EDGE\nPage builder: Squarespace\nGallery: https://www.landing.gallery/websites/yolanta-birkhane-studio\nPage: landing_page \u00b7 desktop\nFull screenshot: https://imagedelivery.net/JG2b3u-FulEpwbFCirpjnw/landinggallery/screenshots/yolanta-birkhane-studio-desktop-21869/public\nOriginal page: https://www.yolantabirkhane.com/"},{"type":"text","text":"2. Casa Lunara\nDescription: Casa Lunara is a fresh eyewear brand mixing bold, editorial vibes with streetwear style. It features standout sunglasses and lets the community help shape what comes next.\nPage builder: Webflow\nGallery: https://www.landing.gallery/websites/casa-lunara\nPage: landing_page \u00b7 desktop\nFull screenshot: https://imagedelivery.net/JG2b3u-FulEpwbFCirpjnw/landinggallery/screenshots/casa-lunara-desktop/public\nOriginal page: https://www.casa-lunara.com/"},{"type":"text","text":"3. Justin Bettman\nDescription: Justin Bettman is a Los Angeles-based advertising and editorial photographer known for his cinematic, highly stylized imagery. His work transforms crafted environments into immersive narratives, blending surreal storytelling with bold compositions.\nPage builder: Framer\nGallery: https://www.landing.gallery/websites/justin-bettman\nPage: landing_page \u00b7 desktop\nFull screenshot: https://imagedelivery.net/JG2b3u-FulEpwbFCirpjnw/landinggallery/screenshots/justin-bettman-desktop/public\nOriginal page: https://justinbettman.com/"}],"structuredContent":{"results":[{"name":"Yolanta Birkhane Studio","slug":"yolanta-birkhane-studio","description":"A SWEDEN BASED WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER BLENDING GENUINE FRAMES WITH AN EDITORIAL EDGE","pagebuilder":{"name":"Squarespace","slug":"squarespace"},"framework":null,"galleryUrl":"https://www.landing.gallery/websites/yolanta-birkhane-studio","screenshot":{"pageType":"landing_page","device":"d